# PART 7 — REFLECTION INTELLIGENCE ENGINE

Implement the entire capture and interpretation pipeline.

When a user submits a reflection:

1. Authenticate the user.
2. Validate the input.
3. Store the original reflection.
4. Send the content to Nemotron through Nebius.
5. Receive structured analysis.
